contentMarkdown:
This classic vintage cardholder is foldable and displays an external card slot for quick access.

This wallet has 3 card slots and 1 sub-pocket for cash or additional cards, and 1 flap pocket mostly for cash and an additional card or ticket.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

